The complete configuration of an ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/abstract-machine.td")} at a point during evaluation, comprising the current term and any auxiliary data (e.g., ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/environment.td")}, store, stack). In ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/pure-untyped-lambda-calculus.td")}, the state is simply a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/lambda-term.td")}.
